# Differential programs the new compiler passes (spec testing/differential-tests). Only grows; by the end of
# m2-numeric-types it names every program. One <group>/<name> per line; run with: run_legacy_tests.py --suite corpus
# --corpus-root tests/differential --list tests/differential/pass.list --qb64 target/release/qb64rust.exe
# The full programs declare all 17 numeric types, so none compiles before the new types do. The old6 group (the six
# old types only, DECISIONS.md 2026-10-08): 27 of 48 on 2026-10-08; its fold and print programs follow with design D7
# (group 4). Tier 1 requires a program here as soon as it compiles cleanly ("clean programs are listed").
old6/ops_add
old6/ops_and
old6/ops_andalso
old6/ops_div
old6/ops_eq
old6/ops_eqv
old6/ops_ge
old6/ops_gt
old6/ops_idiv
old6/ops_imp
old6/ops_le
old6/ops_lt
old6/ops_mod
old6/ops_mul
old6/ops_ne
old6/ops_or
old6/ops_orelse
old6/ops_pow
old6/ops_sub
old6/ops_xor
old6/store_double
old6/store_float
old6/store_int64
old6/store_integer
old6/store_long
old6/store_single
old6/unary_unary
